OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785863931
OL,3,CMan who suffered stroke in front of
OL,4,Chis children hails 'life-changing'
OL,5,Ctreatment
OL,7,FA stroke patient says his life has
OL,8,Fbeen saved thanks to a state of the
OL,9,Fart procedure carried out by East Kent
OL,10,FHospitals.
OL,12,FAnthony Ojo was left unable to speak
OL,13,Fafter collapsing at home in front of
OL,14,Fhis children.
OL,16,FHe's one of the first patients to be
OL,17,Ftreated at a new multi-million pound
OL,18,Fsuite at Kent and Canterbury Hospital-
OL,19,F which offers a pioneering treatment
OL,20,Fto prevent permanent brain damage.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785863931
OL,3,CMan who suffered stroke in front of
OL,4,Chis children hails 'life-changing'
OL,5,Ctreatment
OL,7,FSpeaking to ITV Meridian, Anthony, 41,
OL,8,Fsaid: "I will never forget it.
OL,10,F"Dr Abubakar was asking me to do
OL,11,Fsimple tasks like raising my hands and
OL,12,FI just couldn't do it.
OL,14,F"My children had been asking me
OL,15,Fquestions and I thought I was
OL,16,Fanswering but no words were coming
OL,17,Fout, it was just babbling and I was
OL,18,Fdribbling from one side of my mouth.
OL,26,@pD@GOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785863931
OL,3,CMan who suffered stroke in front of
OL,4,Chis children hails 'life-changing'
OL,5,Ctreatment
OL,7,F"I don't really remember any of it,
OL,8,Fjust waking up in hospital and my wife
OL,9,Fand the doctors telling me I had
OL,10,Fsuffered a major stroke."
OL,12,FSupport worker Anthony, who lives in
OL,13,FAshford, spent four days in hospital
OL,14,Fbut is now recovering at home with his
OL,15,Ffamily.
OL,17,F"The team were top-notch, I cannot
OL,18,Ffault them at all," he added.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@YO]yD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785863931
OL,3,CMan who suffered stroke in front of
OL,4,Chis children hails 'life-changing'
OL,5,Ctreatment
OL,7,F"It was a wake-up call for me, I had
OL,8,Fbeen told I had high blood pressure
OL,9,Fbut I didn't think it was a big deal
OL,10,Fso I didn't always take the
OL,11,Fmedication. I was quite fit and I
OL,12,Fexercised so I thought I was okay, and
OL,13,FI never checked my blood pressure.
OL,15,F"When I went back to church and spoke
OL,16,Fto people, a lot of other people were
OL,17,Fthe same but now they all take it
OL,18,Fseriously.
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785863931
OL,3,CMan who suffered stroke in front of
OL,4,Chis children hails 'life-changing'
OL,5,Ctreatment
OL,7,F"I'm so thankful my wife was at home
OL,8,Fbecause my children' didn't know what
OL,9,Fto do, so now we have given them step-
OL,10,Fby-step instructions in case anything
OL,11,Fhappens in the future."
OL,13,FMore than 1200 people in East Kent
OL,14,Fsuffer from a stroke every year.
OL,16,FMore than 100 of these patients are
OL,17,Flikely to benefit from a thrombectomy.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@WO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785863931
OL,3,CMan who suffered stroke in front of
OL,4,Chis children hails 'life-changing'
OL,5,Ctreatment
OL,7,FDr Robert Kaikini, consultant vascular
OL,8,Fand interventional radiologist and
OL,9,Fstrategy lead for interventional
OL,10,Fradiology, said: "We are delighted to
OL,11,Fbe able to offer this cutting-edge
OL,12,Ftechnology to patients in Kent.
OL,14,F"Anthony's story is the perfect
OL,15,Fexample of how important this service
OL,16,Fis. When he arrived at hospital he was
OL,17,Funable to communicate, but just a few
OL,18,Fdays later he was able to go home,
OL,19,Fwalking and talking normally.
OL,26,@rD@ROUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785863931
OL,3,CMan who suffered stroke in front of
OL,4,Chis children hails 'life-changing'
OL,5,Ctreatment
OL,7,F"Without the procedure, there would be
OL,8,Fno blood flow to part of his brain and
OL,9,Fthe tissue would have died, leaving
OL,10,Fhim with permanent effects.
OL,12,F"Thanks to the team here he is now
OL,13,Ffully recovered and able to carry on
OL,14,Flife with his family."
OL,16,FEast Kent Hospitals acting chief
OL,17,Fexecutive Dr Des Holden said: "I would
OL,18,Flike to thank teams across the Trust
OL,19,Fwho worked incredibly hard to make
OL,20,Fthis vision a reality for our patients.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUvD@VO]yD@_OU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785863931
OL,3,CMan who suffered stroke in front of
OL,4,Chis children hails 'life-changing'
OL,5,Ctreatment
OL,7,F"The Kent Interventional Centre is a
OL,8,Ffantastic facility that uses the most
OL,9,Fadvanced technology to allow our
OL,10,Fclinicians to carry out life-changing
OL,11,Fprocedures for a range of conditions.
OL,13,F"It brings even more first-class
OL,14,Ftreatment options closer to people's
OL,15,Fhomes, sparing patients and their
OL,16,Floved ones the need to travel to
OL,17,FLondon."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUyD@HO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/8
